"Installation was cancelled. Nothing was downloaded or run." = "安装已取消。未下载或运行任何内容。";
"Run the Claude Code installer?" = "要运行 Claude Code 安装程序吗？";
"BlitzTree will download %@ and run it with bash, as you. It is Anthropic's own installer, but it isn't pinned to a checksum and can change between releases. This is the exact command:\n\n%@" = "BlitzTree 将下载 %@ 并以你的身份用 bash 运行。这是 Anthropic 自己的安装程序，但未固定校验和，不同版本之间可能会变化。确切的命令如下：\n\n%@";
"Download and Run" = "下载并运行";
"Enter a full URL, such as https://gateway.example/v1." = "请输入完整的 URL，例如 https://gateway.example/v1。";
"The URL needs a host name, such as gateway.example." = "URL 需要主机名，例如 gateway.example。";
"“%@://” isn't supported. Use https://." = "不支持“%@://”。请使用 https://。";
"“%@” is reached over plain http, so your API key and folder paths would cross the network unencrypted. Use https://. Plain http is allowed only for localhost, 127.0.0.1 and ::1." = "“%@”通过未加密的 http 访问，你的 API 密钥和文件夹路径将以明文在网络上传输。请使用 https://。仅 localhost、127.0.0.1 和 ::1 允许使用纯 http。";
"Couldn't save the API key to the Keychain: %@ (%@)." = "无法将 API 密钥保存到钥匙串：%@ (%@)。";
"The server redirected the request to “%@”, which is a different address, so it was stopped before your API key and folder paths were sent there. Use the final address as the base URL." = "服务器将请求重定向到了另一个地址“%@”，因此在你的 API 密钥和文件夹路径发送过去之前已停止。请使用最终地址作为基础 URL。";
